        "nobel_worthiness": "Trapped-ion proposals and experiments established a practical route to quantum logic, while the broader trapped-ion and ultracold-atom program made controlled quantum simulation a central experimental discipline.",
        "attribution": "Cirac and Zoller supplied key theoretical foundations for ion-trap quantum computation; Blatt demonstrated landmark trapped-ion control. This selection emphasizes that distinctive line of work, though the candidate also includes a broader ultracold-atom contribution.",
